      "created_at": "2016-03-14T14:38:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, my friends and I played a game against a Cauldron villain (fan made expansion) called Gray, who was basically radioactive.&nbsp;We were in Insula Primalis, playing the Prime Wardens. After a round or two, I realized we were basically playing the Planeteers.&nbsp;</p><p>Haka was Earth, being strong, durable, but still has a good heart. Like Kwame.</p><p>Fanatic was Wind; basically she can fly and is a bit temperamental. Like Linka.</p><p>Argent Adept was Heart; though he is not a physical&nbsp;in nature, is there as moral support, making others feel better. Like Ma-Ti</p><p>Captain Cosmic was Fire, creating great forms of energy&nbsp;, which can get out of hand with an explosion. Like Wheeler. Which I find funny that one is American and the other is British. Close enough?</p><p>Tempest was Water.&nbsp;I don't know why. It was the only one that didn't fit. :P</p><p><span>We won, but we were missing a green-mulleted blue-metal skinned speedo wearing eco-wizard.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
