      "cooked": "<p>Rofl cool...I used to watch that cartoon and vaguely remember it. Couldn't remotely remember their names but I <em>can</em> remember the lyrics to the first part of the theme song (\"Captain Planet, he's a hero, gonna take pollution down to zero!\") and the \"Earth, Fire, Wind, Water, Heart!\" shout out that they all do with their magic rings. Yay for old cartoons :D.</p>",
